    "headline": "Why Is Western Digital Stock Sinking Thursday?",
    "summary": "Western Digital Corp. (NASDAQ:WDC) stock traded lower Thursday despite reporting fiscal fourth-quarter earnings and revenue that beat Wall Street estimates. Despite the earnings beat, Western Digital’s outlook fell short of elevated investor expectations, triggering a sector-wide pullback in AI memory and storage stocks. Peers including Seagate Technology Holdings plc (NASDAQ:STX) and Sandisk Corp. (NASDAQ:SNDK) also traded lower Thursday. Read Also: Bigger Earnings, Bigger Drop: The Sandisk Sel",
